# Admin UI is English-only

`app/admin` is an internal console. Keep copy in English.

- Do not wrap admin strings in Lingui `t`, `Trans`, or `msg`
- Do not add admin copy to `locales/`
- Do not follow the signed-in user locale or `Accept-Language`
- Format numbers and dates in English (`en` / `en-US` / `en-GB`)
